# #7648 — the Azure Repos provider types leave MeshWeaver.GitSync (step 3 of 3 of the carve-out);
# the provider is contributed from MeshWeaver.Plugins (#4727). Measured: no repository outside core
# names any of them, so no module compiled against an earlier platform binds the old TypeRef.
